# will_kind_target — a target named by kind is answered by every item of that kind
#
# Mycology wants "a mushroom" (YieldingKind(ItemKind.Mushroom)), not the Mushroom class: the desert
# truffle is its own class, a vegetable, and carries the Mushroom kind, so it answers. Desert id 1,
# from the Wadi: the way leads to the Truffle Ground and ends on gathering a truffle.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --grant-mm mycology --location-type desert --location-id 1 --start-area Wadi --period morning

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60
advance 12 180

expect-state will "gather a desert truffle"
expect-state will "gather mushrooms"
quit
